{
  "name": "loop-context-overflow-recover",
  "about": "provider 报上下文超长、恢复一次后成功（loop-model-errors 里没有这两种码：provider 一直回这类错误时 truncate_head_and_retry 没有次数上限，见 context/recovery/ContextOverflowRecovery.ts:66-74 与 agent/loop/AgentLoop.ts:1561-1575）。会话先有一轮正常对话（带标记 MARK1），第二轮的请求只要还带着 MARK1 就报错；恢复把历史压掉后请求里不再有 MARK1，provider 回正常文本。c-ptl：400「prompt is too long」→ model/errors/normalizeModelError.ts:146 prompt_too_long；c-ovf：400「maximum context length」→ 175 行 context_overflow；两者 recoverableViaCompact（75）→ ContextOverflowRecovery.decide 给 compact_and_retry（第一次）→ AgentLoop.ts:1476-1559 压缩（摘要请求带 internal-compaction-control）后 turn_continued(model_error) 重试。",
  "provider": [
    {
      "name": "title",
      "when": [
        "Generate a concise title"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "{\"title\":\"Overflow\"}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "summary",
      "when": [
        "internal-compaction-control"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "<summary>Earlier the user said hello.</summary>"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ptl-error",
      "when": [
        "c-ptl second:",
        "MARK1"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "status": 400,
        "body": {
          "error": {
            "message": "prompt is too long: 70000 tokens > 65536 maximum",
            "type": "invalid_request_error"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ovf-error",
      "when": [
        "c-ovf second:",
        "MARK1"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "status": 400,
        "body": {
          "error": {
            "message": "This model's maximum context length is 65536 tokens. Please reduce the length of the messages.",
            "type": "invalid_request_error"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "second-ok",
      "when": [
        "second:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Recovered after overflow."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "first",
      "when": [
        "MARK1"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Hello back."
      }
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-ptl",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "message": "MARK1 hello"
      },
      "timeout": 20000
    },
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-ptl",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "message": "c-ptl second: go"
      },
      "timeout": 30000
    },
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-ovf",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "message": "MARK1 hello"
      },
      "timeout": 20000
    },
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-ovf",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "message": "c-ovf second: go"
      },
      "timeout": 30000
    },
    {
      "sleep": 500
    },
    {
      "ws": "read_session_messages",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-ptl"
      }
    }
  ]
}
